msgid "LongBackgammon"
msgstr "Uzyn nardy"

#: data/io.github.ansribas.LongBackgammon.desktop.in:3
#: data/io.github.ansribas.LongBackgammon.metainfo.xml.in:8
msgid "Classic Long Backgammon Board Game"
msgstr "Klassiki uzyn nardy stoluň oýny"

#: data/io.github.ansribas.LongBackgammon.desktop.in:9
msgid "GTK;Backgammon;Game;"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Long Backgammon is a popular variant of backgammon played with fifteen "
"checkers on a standard board. Players compete to move all their checkers "
"into the home board and bear them off first, following strict strategic "
"rules and smart positioning."
msgstr ""
"Uzyn nardy standart tagtada on bäş daş bilen oýnalýan nardyň meşhur "
"görnüşidir. Oýunçylar berk strategiki düzgünlere eýerip we akylly "
"ýerleşdirip, ähli daşlaryny ilki öz öýüne getirip, tagtadan çykarmak üçin "
"ýaryşýarlar."

#: data/io.github.ansribas.LongBackgammon.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Aleksey Svetlov"
msgstr ""

msgid "Classic match and gameplay"
msgstr "Klassiki oýun we oýun barşy"

msgid "Game settings, visual themes, and audio preferences"
msgstr "Oýun sazlamalary, wizual temalar we ses ukyplary"

msgid "Interactive rules guide and match scoring"
msgstr "Interaktiw düzgünler gollanmasy we oýun hasaby"

msgid ""
"GNOME Human Interface Guidelines alignment: standard Libadwaita header bar "
"button sizing and symbolic icons, primary menu placed next to window "
"controls, system GSettings integration, GNOME HIG color palette, relative "
"typography scale for accessibility, interactive Keyboard Shortcuts window "
"(Ctrl+?), and donation link support."
msgstr ""
"GNOME HIG standartlaryna laýyklaşdyrmak: Libadwaita başlyk zolagynyň "
"düwmeleriniň standart ölçegleri we simwolik nyşanlar, esasy menýunyň penjire "
"düwmeleriniň ýanynda ýerleşmegi, GSettings integrasiýasy, GNOME HIG reňk "
"paletrasy, elýeterlilik üçin gabat gelýän şrift ölçegi, interaktiw "
"klawiatura gysga ýollary penjiresi (Ctrl+?) we haýyr-sahawat baglanyşygynyň "
"goldawy."

msgid ""
"Configurable board side selection (Left / Right) with smooth transitions, "
"animated checker collection into trays, panel docking sound effects, hidden "
"stats reset trigger, and rolloff flow enhancements."
msgstr ""
"Tagta tarapyny saýlamak (çep / sag) ýumşak geçişler bilen, daşlaryň "
"lotoklara animasiýaly ýygnalmagy, panelleriň birikdirilmegi üçin ses "
"effektleri, statistikany gizlin arassalamak we daşlary çykarmak prosesiniň "
"gowulandyrylmagy."

msgid "Initial release of Long Backgammon for Linux."
msgstr "Long Backgammon-yň Linux üçin ilkinji neşiri."

